WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,960
The old minister just warned us

2
00:00:04,060 --> 00:00:05,540
Taking advantage of the security guard

3
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:08,060
I'm afraid it will lead to fire.

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,300
The old minister is old and timid.

5
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:12,900
This security guard is just an ordinary person

6
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,100
What's there to worry about?

7
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,340
Our ghost bureau

8
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,500
From now on, there is no need to worry about any ghosts anymore

9
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,460
But listen to the old minister’s wishes

10
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,300
I'm afraid he can make 4S-level ghosts

11
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,460
Both of us listened to his words

12
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,460
Not yet a rival to 4S-level ghosts

13
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,900
You forgot that we are in the ghost formation

14
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:29,860
Is that the ghost weapon that has been sealed for a long time?
